# No Inline CSS

- Never use `style={{}}` on components
- Never use inline CSS strings or ad-hoc CSS modules
- Use Tailwind utility classes, `cn()`, and `cva` from `@/lib/utils`
- Charts: use Recharts props or Tailwind on wrappers — not inline styles

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div style={{ padding: 16 }} className="flex">

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="flex p-4">
```
